      "Microsoft.VSTS.Common.AcceptanceCriteria": "<ul><li>When a returning customer with saved payment details reaches checkout, the saved method is available for selection without re-entering card details. </li><li>When a customer opts to save payment details and payment completes, the details are stored for future checkouts. </li><li>When a saved method is used at checkout and payment completes, the customer reaches the confirmation page. </li> </ul>",
